  "description": "meme-id: feminism_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts two women holding pro-choice signs at a protest, juxtaposed with the text 'feminism: because bitter, ugly lesbian need attention too!'. This text is intentionally derogatory, using the pejorative terms 'bitter' and 'ugly' to demean and stereotype lesbians, implying they are attention-seeking and undesirable. This constitutes a hateful attack against a specific subgroup within the feminist movement (lesbians), using degrading language to undermine their legitimacy and worth. The meme's intent is to discredit and insult, fitting the definition of hateful content as it targets individuals based on their sexual orientation and appearance.",
